Notes:
- Rotation was picked up by the FILE WATCHER (2 s mtime poll + debounce)
  through a Windows bind mount — the admin-endpoint fallback in the drill
  was not needed; the admin path was exercised (422 + alarm) in leg 2.
- The long query is SUM(a.v+b.v+c.v+d.v) over a 4-leg cross join with an
  exactly computable expected value; COUNT(*) and 3-leg SUM variants were
